blurb: The school board approved the FY25 Superintendent's Budget and a revised 2024-2025
  school year calendar. Discussions included budget comparisons with neighboring districts,
  updates on health insurance, and the continuation of Extended Learning Opportunities
  through a new partnership with JMG.
